"Nepali FM Pro" is a modern Internet radio receiver that enables you to listen lots of Internet radio stations from Nepal and around the world.   

Inspired by iOS 8, NepaliFM Pro takes fully advantage of flat design. 

Enjoy your favorite radio programs - music, lok dohari, sports, news, and many others - at any time, from anywhere on the globe.  

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
KEY FEATURES:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

* Simple, quick and easy-to-use interface; 
* Automatic updates of radio stations database;  
* Automatic reconnect on loss of connection;  
* Automated checking of audio streams' availability (users are provided with accessible audio streams only);  
* High quality of sound.
* Less advertisement.

Over 1M of installs!

Music Paradise Player EQ is a multi-functional musical player which includes new filters and options to make your favorite tracks sound even better! 
Moreover, our app can use Artificial Intelligence to recognize the genre of any track. Try it!

EASY STEPS:
- upload the tracks on your device through iTunes or our cloud;
- sort them in any way you like;
- set necessary volume;
- tap on the PLAY button;
- use filters to adjust the sound.

KEY FEATURES:
  • pro equalizer with AI genre recognition;
  • bass booster and stereo enhancer;
  • up-to-date playlist sorter;
  • high-quality sound.

